uit and tie can be changed).\n∙ Can change the type and placement of earrings.\n・He is very expressive.\nLikes to smoke more than anything else in the world. I like smoking more than anything else in the world.\nI am a man who has a good style and good face, and who gets sick just because a woman comes near him because he had a lot of problems with male-female relationships during his school days.\n\n They are supposed to be friends, but you can interpret that as you like! You can do whatever you want!\n\n\nI will use your drawings for icons and wallpapers!\nThank you for your cooperation. ‼️", "nc": 1, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@rqpm12_58/works/1", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2381808, "client_id": 484790, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/b2679903/uploads/origins/c47552fa-5830-4419-9b05-7003e7262dcc?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=69256a0f9097a85eeb547b746fb10552", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/b2679903/uploads/origins/c47552fa-5830-4419-9b05-7003e7262dcc?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=69256a0f9097a85eeb547b746fb10552, https://si.imgix.net/b2679903/uploads/origins/c47552fa-5830-4419-9b05-7003e7262dcc?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=26efed8f550a5008ccc55a079d967bd7 2x, https://si.imgix.net/b2679903/uploads/origins/c47552fa-5830-4419-9b05-7003e7262dcc?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=eb79c06dd482ed35f77e5672cc8a6683 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/b2679903/uploads/origins/c47552fa-5830-4419-9b05-7003e7262dcc?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=88961db64163ac1b6ce943733b478070", "srcset"